    description: { de: "Das Haus, in dem der berühmte Dichter Rubén Darío seine Kindheit verbrachte.", hu: "A ház, ahol a híres költő, Rubén Darío a gyermekkorát töltötte.", ro: "Casa în care celebrul poet Rubén Darío și-a petrecut copilăria.", en: "The house where the famous poet Rubén Darío spent his childhood." },
