      en: "The actual house where the poet was born, in the city that now bears his name. Birthplace of Rubén Darío is known for: national monument, simple adobe house, museum honoring his life and work. This region plays an important role in Nicaragua's geography and culture and represents a significant part of the national heritage. Birthplace of Rubén Darío is part of Nicaragua's cultural heritage."
