      en: "Historic region of gold and silver mining operated by foreign companies. Mining Triangle (historic) is known for: important source of revenue for the country, scene of labor conflicts, multicultural melting pot. This region plays an important role in Nicaragua's geography and culture and represents a significant part of the national heritage. Mining Triangle (historic) is part of Nicaragua's cultural heritage."
